              "subArc": "Sub-Arc C: The Clock Tower Without a Shadow",
              "summary": "The central clock tower stood at the end of a boulevard no street wished to approach directly. Every road curved. Every alley pretended to lead elsewhere. Even the snow avoided its base, rising in slow..."
