                "The hourless watch remained quiet for most of the road, but Helena began to feel its silence as attention. It was not guiding her like a compass. It was waiting for her to make the decision herself. That, somehow, felt more like Astraeon than any spoken warning: an ancient creature leaving the youngest heart in the room to choose whether it wanted pain or ignorance.",
                "Kael laughs so hard the guard asks whether he requires medical attention."
