                "No one speaks for a while.",
                "Yet beneath the absurdity, something colder moved. Portraits corrected smiles when no one watched. Royal seals appeared on documents the queen had never signed. A corridor that led to the armory yesterday led to a memorial room today. Eleanor was not merely hiding records. It was being edited while they stood inside it.",
                "Then Valerius asks, with scholarly despair, whether anyone else would like to retire into farming."
