                "The wards stack into a beautiful fortress of logic. Helena whispers Turn Null. The fortress does not break. It simply forgets why it was standing.",
                "Helena thought of Eirvalen, of a city paused by fear, and wondered whether Eleanor had chosen a gentler prison. Instead of freezing time, it had frozen an image. The Ancient Sage as mother, founder, goddess, weapon, proof. Anything except a person who could look back and say the story was wrong.",
                "Half the academy applauds. The other half considers religious conversion."
