                "Helena wonders how many times history has been injured by curiosity.",
                "The deeper they went, the more Helena felt the distance between memory and origin. She remembered a life. She trusted that life. But trust did not make the edges less strange. Perhaps, she thought, a person was not the sum of what began them, but of what they refused to abandon after beginning.",
                "Then she opens the first book anyway."
