              "source": "Chapter lengkap",
              "content": [
                "Founding Account Zero tells a version of Eleanor's birth that no school teaches. The kingdom did not begin with a treaty or a crowned ruler. It began with refugees hiding inside the ruins of a swamp fortress while Helena held a rift closed for nine nights.",
                "She remembers five of those nights. The other four are blank.",
                "In the margin, Eleanor wrote: Teacher slept standing up. Her eyes looked like a broken star on the seventh night.",
                "The Lunar Vault demanded humility. Every step deeper stripped away ceremony until only breath, footsteps, and moonlight remained. Even Queen Ilysera stopped standing like a queen. Seraphel stopped sounding like an archivist. Valerius stopped reaching for terminology. Helena appreciated the silence, though she no longer trusted silence to be empty.",
                "Helena closes the book with more care than fear."
              ],
