                "Most are ordinary. I hate mud. Barret snores. Cedric is nice. Helena looks sad when no one sees.",
                "Elara moved through the vault as if walking inside a sickroom. She touched no forbidden book without permission, yet every wounded record leaned subtly toward her. Kael noticed and became uncomfortable. He had prepared to guard bodies, not melancholy shelves. Vane whispered that old things sometimes needed witnesses more than repairs.",
                "The final message reads: The other Helena came back bleeding moonlight."
