                "When the vault's guardians rose, Helena understood they were not evil. They were functions grown desperate after centuries of contradictory orders: preserve truth, protect the kingdom, hide the wound, honor Helena, prevent Helena from knowing why she was honored. No spell should be forced to carry that many lies. No nation should either.",
