                "The first page opens by itself.",
                "No one asked Helena whether she wanted to continue. They had learned better. Elara stayed near enough to catch her if the truth wounded more than pride. Valerius stayed ready with notes because fear had never entirely defeated curiosity. Kael stayed by the door, blade drawn, glaring at history as if it might rush him.",
