                "Turn Null rises instinctively around her fingers.",
                "When the archive shook, Helena felt the old temptation to answer scale with scale: pressure for pressure, law for law, star for star. Instead, she breathed. The Helena worshiped in murals might have raised a hand and ended the room. The Helena standing there wanted the frightened books to survive the truth they had carried.",
